    "title": "Treasury average interest rate total interest-bearing debt closest to 2026-09-30",
    "published": null,
    "text": "- 2022-02-28 — TreasuryDirect’s “Average Interest Rates on U.S. Treasury Securities” page shows that average interest rates are calculated on the total unmatured interest-bearing debt, and that the **Total Interest-bearing Debt** average interest rate for **February 28, 2022** was **1.556%**. Source: https://www.treasurydirect.gov/government/public-debt-reports/average-monthly-interest/ ([treasurydirect.gov](https://www.treasurydirect.gov/government/public-debt-reports/average-monthly-interest/))\n\n- 2022-02-28 — The same TreasuryDirect page states that the average interest rates for **total marketable, total non-marketable, and total interest-bearing debt do not include Treasury Inflation-Protected Securities (TIPS) and Treasury Floating Rate Notes (FRNs)**. Source: https://www.treasurydirect.gov/government/public-debt-reports/average-monthly-interest/ ([treasurydirect.gov](https://www.treasurydirect.gov/government/public-debt-reports/average-monthly-interest/))\n\n- 2025-07-31 — Treasury Fiscal Data’s published “Schedules of Federal Debt” PDF for **July 31, 2025** says the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs** was **3.1%**. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n- 2025-01-31 — Treasury Fiscal Data’s published “Schedules of Federal Debt” PDF for **January 31, 2025** says the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs** was **3.0%**. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202501.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202501.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n- 2025-05-31 — Treasury Fiscal Data’s published “Schedules of Federal Debt” PDF for **May 31, 2025** says the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs** was **2.9%**. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\nNote: I could not verify a Treasury source specifically dated **2026-09-30** because that date is in the future relative to today, and the closest official monthly/public-debt materials I found were prior-period TreasuryDirect and Fiscal Data publications."
